<BehaviorPatch #track.r_2_0_2_6_-_0_8_-_0_3_-_1_6_1_9_-_a_d_d_-_t_u_i_-_c_o_m_p_o_s_e_r_-_a_t_t_a_c_h_m_e_n_t_s.behavior_patch.runtime-session-persistence apiVersion="codument.tech/v1alpha1" version="1" { capability = "runtime-session-persistence" } (
  <Mutations [
    <Upsert { selector = "behavior://runtime-session-persistence/requirements/provider-secret-redaction" } (
      <Requirement #provider-secret-redaction (
        <Statement ?01M05F1PNXWW8VNQKS9CS2CN6D>
        Durable runtime snapshot SHALL 保留 actor 的 provider/model/capability 选择，但 MUST NOT 以明文保存 provider API key、authorization、token、secret 或嵌套 connection credential；恢复时脱敏占位符 MUST NOT 被当作有效凭据，真实凭据 SHALL 从当前 provider 配置重新注入。
        </?01M05F1PNXWW8VNQKS9CS2CN6D>
        <Suites [
          <Suite #actor-snapshot-secrets { name = "Actor snapshot 凭据安全" } (
            <Cases [
              <Case #actor-json-redacts-provider-key [
                <Then ?01M05F1PNXWW8VNQKS9CS2CN6E>
                actor.json MUST NOT 包含任一原始 secret
                </?01M05F1PNXWW8VNQKS9CS2CN6E>
                <Then ?01M05F1PNXWW8VNQKS9CS2CN6F>
                非敏感 provider、model、base URL、limits 与 capabilities SHALL 保持可恢复
                </?01M05F1PNXWW8VNQKS9CS2CN6F>
              ] (
                <Given ?01M05F1PNXWW8VNQKS9CS2CN6G>
                actor modelConfig 与嵌套 options 含 provider API key/authorization/token
                </?01M05F1PNXWW8VNQKS9CS2CN6G>
                <When ?01M05F1PNXWW8VNQKS9CS2CN6H>
                runtime 写入 actors/*/actor.json
                </?01M05F1PNXWW8VNQKS9CS2CN6H>
              )>
              <Case #recovery-rehydrates-current-credential (
                <Given ?01M05F1PNXWW8VNQKS9CS2CN6J>
                session actor snapshot 的凭据已经脱敏且当前 provider 配置含有效凭据
                </?01M05F1PNXWW8VNQKS9CS2CN6J>
                <When ?01M05F1PNXWW8VNQKS9CS2CN6K>
                runtime 恢复 actor 并创建 provider adapter
                </?01M05F1PNXWW8VNQKS9CS2CN6K>
                <Then ?01M05F1PNXWW8VNQKS9CS2CN6M>
                脱敏值 MUST NOT 覆盖当前配置，provider/model 选择 SHALL 保持，adapter SHALL 使用当前配置凭据
                </?01M05F1PNXWW8VNQKS9CS2CN6M>
              )>
            ]>
          )>
        ]>
      )>
    )>
  ]>
)>
